      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Integrate the arithmetic oracle into the Hspec suite**\n\nWhen developers or validation lanes run the documented `stack test` command, this standalone `Main` module is skipped because it is only invoked by the bespoke command in `ci.yml`; consequently, its 400 transition and 512 ledger boundary checks can silently stop running outside that workflow. Convert the probe to an Hspec `*.Spec.hs` module and register it with the existing test suite so the standard backend test command includes this regression coverage.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [tdf-hq/AGENTS.md:L24-L28](https://github.com/diegueins680/tdf-app/blob/b966595e267c6365830fa5e60abd3e707838ad59/tdf-hq/AGENTS.md#L24-L28)\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
